## Deliberate Exclusions

| Pattern | Why |
|---|---|
| `*-review-*decisions.md` | Audit trail of how the specs reached their current state; superseded positions read as current out of context |
| `review-changelog.md` | Same; reader-facing delta belongs in `00-what-changed.md` |
| `*-analysis-*.md`, `*-agenda.md` | Working documents, not specifications |
| Projects not in the resolved slice | Not delivered by this release; references to them are classified, not dangling |
| `0_context/` | Inputs the concept was written from; superseded by the concept itself |
| `2_visual-companion/` | Structural UI exploration that precedes the mockups it produced |
| `4_design/` | Design-system source; the mockups carry the rendered result |
| `8_handoff/` | Dated per-project handoff runs. **A handoff is a snapshot, this package is derived** — anything in a handoff that is live state (an open-decisions register) belongs in the project folder, where it is copied from |

**Directories are listed even when empty of findings.** A packager that silently skips a source
directory reads, to a later reader, exactly like one that found nothing there.
